<title>USA: Reckson Associates Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Reckson Associates Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.51		    $0.33</p>
<p> Net			  6,784		    2,423</p>
<p> Revs			29,835		   18,462</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  16,765		   10,477</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 FFO per share $0.83 vs $0.76.</p>
<p>1996 Q1 includes a charge of $895,000, or $0.12 a share.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk   212-859-1610))</p>
